    "storyTitle": "This is the story of a little boy who dreamed of becoming a cardiologist",
    "story1": "Twenty-two years ago, in a kingdom ringed by volcanoes, a little boy with dark curls and a mischievous smile came into the world. He was still very small when he discovered that the kingdom’s most precious treasure was not locked away in any castle: it was beating, hidden, inside each and every person.",
